# Cloudflare Pages Static Assets Caching & Security Headers

/avatar/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
